    {
      "id": "measure-for-measure/sceneI_21.1/p@4237",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "What figure of us think you he will bear?\nFor you must know we have with special soul\nElected him our absence to supply;\nLent him our terror, drest him with our love,\nAnd given his deputation all the organs\nOf our own power. What think you of it?",
