      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ANGELO.\n’Tis so with me. Let us withdraw together,\nAnd we may soon our satisfaction have\nTouching that point.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
